\title{Free Slots}
\maketitle

\section{Overview}

The program reads booked time slots from standard input, one per line
in the form [[09:00-10:30]], and prints the free slots of the working
day 08:00--17:00 in the same format.
Bookings may overlap, touch, and arrive in any order.

The approach: convert times to minutes since midnight, sort the
bookings by start, sweep through them while keeping a cursor at the end
of the covered time, and emit a gap whenever the next booking starts
after the cursor.
Bookings outside the working day are clipped to it.

